.TH tkusearchbar n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkusearchbar
.PP
Search bar: an entry with a debounced change callback, a clear button, and an optional filter drop\-down. Typing fires \fB\-command\fR after \fB\-delay\fR ms of inactivity; clearing and changing the filter fire immediately.
.SS API
.CS
set w [::tkutils::tkusearchbar::widget .s ?-command cmd? ?-delay ms? \
        ?-filters list? ?-width n?]
::tkutils::tkusearchbar::getText     $w
::tkutils::tkusearchbar::setText     $w text     ;# programmatic, does not fire
::tkutils::tkusearchbar::clear       $w
::tkutils::tkusearchbar::getFilter   $w
::tkutils::tkusearchbar::setFilter   $w value
::tkutils::tkusearchbar::focusSearch $w
.CE
.PP
\fB\-command\fR is called as \fBcmd searchText filterValue\fR (filter is "" when no \fB\-filters\fR were given). Default \fB\-delay\fR is 300 ms.
.SS "Additional exported commands"
.PP
Documented for completeness (same module, also covered by the test suite):
.CS
tkusearchbar::setFilters path filters          ;# replace the filter drop-down's choices at runtime. If the bar was created without -filters, the separator and combobox are built lazily here. The first value becomes the current filter. Selecting an entry fires -command
.CE
